stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed: agent proposes action<br/>(refund / reply / escalation)
    Proposed --> Pending: write idempotency key + payload hash to scratchpad
    Pending --> Approved: person approves (role ≥ required)
    Pending --> Rejected: person rejects + reason
    Pending --> TimedOut: no answer in 15 min
    Approved --> Executed: tool runs with approval bound<br/>to exact order + amount / reply text
    Executed --> Logged: refund_id / reply_id written
    Rejected --> Alternative: agent drafts alternative<br/>(goes back to a person)
    TimedOut --> HumanQueue: holding reply · nothing irreversible
    Alternative --> Logged
    HumanQueue --> Logged
    Logged --> [*]

